#   species — Mirror Model query→graph-path navigator)
# - ~/dev/systemic.engineering/blog/weird/3published/Weird - Violence.md
#   (manifesto ancestor; verbatim citations in each operation docblock)
#
# === Substrate decisions ===
#
# [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]] (this shard IS mirror
#   source at shards/mirror/reflection.mirror),
# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]] (`prism @mirror/reflection`),
# [[architecture-glass-wall-substrate-types]] (transparency inheritance
#   via `in @glass`; verdict is the discharge floor),
# [[architecture-form-process-partition-at-family-root]] (interaction
#   discipline lives under @mirror form-side; the ACT of reflecting is
